    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴγδις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mortar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Damocr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.130
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.89
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.642
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>): cited as obsol. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυεία</span>
			by <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.234
			</span></i>:—the form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴγδη</span></b>  in Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.523
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Democr.
			</span></i>Alch. <i><span class="en">
				p.55
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i> is prob. incorrect. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
